OL,3,GNEWSAWhy are councillors trying to stop
OL,4,Avape, phone and barber shops?
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillors could be given more powers
OL,7,Fto block vape, barber and mobile phone
OL,8,Fshops from opening in Southend-on-Sea.
OL,10,FA motion to be heard by city
OL,11,Fcouncillors later today warns the
OL,12,Fcity's High Street is at risk of
OL,13,F"over-concentration" of such
OL,14,Fbusinesses.
OL,16,FWhat could the Labour-run authority
OL,17,Factually do - and why does it want
OL,18,Ffewer of these shops?
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
