OL,3,GNEWSAWhy are councillors trying to stop
OL,4,Avape, phone and barber shops?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere are 16 mobile phone outlets, 11
OL,7,Fvape units and nine barber shops on
OL,8,FSouthend's High Street, according to
OL,9,FJames Rourke, a Reform UK councillor
OL,10,Fwho is backing the motion.
